# {{SERVICE_NAME}}

Production-oriented FastAPI runtime template sample. It contains operational health only: no AuditFact, database, broker, auth, or business routes.

The generated hash lockfiles `requirements.txt` and `requirements-dev.txt` are intentionally excluded from template parity; they are generated from the service-local `.in` inputs.

## Local commands

Create a Python 3.12+ virtual environment, bootstrap from the pinned development lock, then run:

```text
python -m pip install --require-hashes -r requirements-dev.txt
python -m ruff check src tests
python -m ruff format --check src tests
python -m mypy src tests
set PYTHONPATH=src && python -m unittest discover -s tests
python -m build --wheel --outdir <temporary-output-directory>  # run from a fresh temporary copy
uvicorn {{MODULE_NAME}}.main:create_app --factory --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000 --timeout-graceful-shutdown 30
```

The runtime requires the service-local `{{ENV_PREFIX}}` configuration fields documented by `{{MODULE_NAME}}.settings`; it does not require a credential. Never place secrets in command lines or logs.
